{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"We gotta teach you how to enforce some discipline on the swarm.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:12:52.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880484957183701082","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"she nods. 'Well, it is a learning experience...'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:13:21.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880485078826909746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Also, Great Plains sounds like a great name. And you,\" she plucks a random insect, \"Hm. I don't know what to name you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:13:27.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880485105351688203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'Great Plains, huh... sounds like there'll be boulders. A lot of them.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:14:09.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880485279583051786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Possible. I suppose with everything seeming bigger in Arcania, even pebbles in rivers will be massive.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:17:22.559000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486090262319104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"We should travel along a river or something. Always stay close to Mr. Gil.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:17:44.144000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486180796375120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'Absolutely.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:19:18.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486575618789406","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'But if it's not possible, I'll make small ponds along the way - so I can hydrate, too. Hopefully that'll work.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:19:43.827000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486682783281183","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oh, I'm definitely packing a bag that's full of only water.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:20:00.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486752693940304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Look here, though. Bigger rivers are going to the bay, we'd be more crossing them rather than going along.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:20:09.648000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486791084388392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Water is really important and we should never run out.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:20:12.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486803105259541","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oh yeah, you used to have a full container where you kept Orphy.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:20:30.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880486876929208370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"`I miss the old thing, but flight's better.`","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:21:04.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880487023029403699","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'We won't run out... or, well, I won't. Gil taught me how to just... create water from nowhere.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:21:27.243000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880487116541411358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'Sort of a useful thing to be able to do if you rely on it to survive.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:21:39.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880487168332668949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oh, that's gonna be so good. I am still bringing a bag full of water, because I think it's just a fun thing to have.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:22:28.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880487372402348044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oh yeah, I figured it out too. Good to have backups.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:24:38.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880487920195211344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'Yeah... I need to do some research.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:26:44.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880488448845283328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"We might actually need to work on the airship, so we can let it on water.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:27:02.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880488524560892015","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"The Ball-Eater, I mean. Though I was planning to give it a new name.","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:27:21.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880488601501184010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'I know what I am, now, but... Irynx, I don't suppose you know how long Grung normally live?'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:27:24.371000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880488614444806164","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"No idea to be honest. Thinking about it now, there were definitely some of your folk around the forest and the swamps, but it's hard to tell how long one lives for.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:28:30.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880488892741087253","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'I see... I'll need to look into that, just so I have a vague idea. Though at the same time, I'm not even sure how old I am. Young adult is all I know.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:30:05.117000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880489288662405141","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"I don't know how long this new body of mine will last either, actually.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:31:13.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880489575393415229","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oh man....\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:31:22.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880489614979264572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"Turns out staring your own mortality in the face after living over 800 years, is not a fun time.","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:31:40.273000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880489687775576094","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'...are you alright?'","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:31:57.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880489761410793472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oh, yeah, just, you know. I've never thought about me dying *normally* before.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:32:44.461000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880489956999585882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Killed by hags or sea furies, or falling off a waterfall, all the exciting ways to go. And I gave up some of my natural lifespan to the fey. I don't know how long I'll last.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:33:49.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880490229537067039","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"'...oh...' she goes to hug her.","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:34:04.822000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880490294058025030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
