{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"In the city, there's always maintenance and refueling and parts if needed. Out west we'll be hard pressed to find anyway to moor. And not many routes we can go by river. Maybe if we turned a small one into a land vehicle?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:41:26.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880492144798879795","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"880392907335548988","content":"\"Oof, now I'm remembering Mr. Mal's wedding gift to Sonny and Fuddles. That box-boat-thing would be so good. But yes! An airship that can become a land-ship could work.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T16:44:15.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880492856781983814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
